!Sample_description = 13935242C
!Sample_description = circRNA-Seq
!Sample_data_processing = CircRNA-Seq high throughput sequencing and subsequent bioinformatics analysis were all done by Cloud-Seq Biotech (Shanghai, China). Paired-end reads were harvested from Illumina HiSeq 4000 sequencer, and were quality controlled by Q30.
!Sample_data_processing = After 3’ adaptor-trimming and low quality reads removing by cutadapt software (v1.9.3). The reads were aligned to the reference genome/transcriptome with STAR software and circRNAs were detected and annotated with DCC software
!Sample_data_processing = circBase database and circ2Trait disease database were used to annotated the identified circRNAs. Raw junction reads for all samples were normalized by total reads number and log2 transformed.
!Sample_data_processing = Differentially expressed circRNAs were identified by ttest between two groups.
!Sample_data_processing = Genome_build: hg19
!Sample_data_processing = Supplementary_files_format_and_content: Number of raw junction read
